<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOHAMMEDIA BEAT JASPER 2-0 IN AFRICAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOHAMMEDIA BEAT JASPER 2-0 IN AFRICAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mohammedia of Morocco beat Jasper United of Nigeria 2-0 (halftime 2-0) in an African Confederation Football Cup second round first leg match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ali Seghir 10, Ziati Noureddine 36 pen.</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
